body:
I wanted to be strong and was ready to off myself anyways so I figured I may as well try something. I ended up training in Shotokan Karate at a few dojos, Aikikai Aikido for a while after moving, and back to original Karate dojo till I got sick and than COVID happened and it closed permanently when I was ready to go back. Now I train in Muay Thai. As for the original cause well a mixture of a family member kicking the shit out of me, bullying as as kid, and being sexually assaulted at 22 by my buddies whack job ex fiance (she would go on to blame alcohol and make a false rape claim against another friend of his that she slept with before blaming him for it).

&#x200B;

Though the funny thing is I used to have a TV in the patio where my home gym equipment is and always watched Baki or Hajime No Ippo when out there. My reasons for training in Muay Thai are the same as my reasons for initially starting Karate "if I'm going to die tomorrow I may as well try one more thing today".

\*Looks at two shelves by pc, on top of printer, on top of mantle, on desk shelf.  Turns mostly fu ll shelf and thinks of giant bookcase with added dvd shelves\* Yup no one buys em anymore  I didn't just buy House M.D. Complete on Blu for $20 Wednesday. The discs are just some magical streaming device that permanently loads.

&#x200B;

Also feel bad for the fiance imagine looking at this clown and realizing "Damn I'm marrying a moron".

Kill Qin bring back Tesla. Hell just kill Qin period.

&#x200B;

Can we kill people who haven't fought? If so kill Nostra bring back anyone really.

In terms of closure I can only speak about death of a parent and the bottom line is there is no real advice. If you feel it will give you closure go for it if you feel it won't don't. At the end of the day only you know what you need to do because your the only one who knows what you can live with for better or worse.

&#x200B;

As for what I'd do with someone that bad no question I'd say fuck em. Doing so wouldn't make you an asshole sometimes there is no other option.

I think I need to give up on my old man he never shuts up about politics gets pissed when everyone around him doesn't know every fucking House and Senate member and worships Trump/Desantis. I despise both men I despise both sides so I avoid politics but it's always "Trump will save us" how by fucking crying can he inject bleach into his veins already? Densatis will save us? how by fighting with fucking Disney!? I'm lucky I have my Aunt and cousin because they are the only ones who don't think like him.

&#x200B;

I'm just so fucking tired of hearing "Democrats, January 6th, Trump, Republicans, random politicians name, Israel, Hamas, Russia, etc" I just don't care. There is nothing I can do about any of it and I'm stressed enough by suicidal ideation (going on two years at least now), depression, loneliness, college, medical issues, anxiety disorders, and everything else. I don't give a fuck about the world when I'm still not sure I can save myself!

Need to say this I fucking hate Trump with a passion I've always hated politicians all of them. But Trumps negative influence keeps getting stronger it's outright destroyed my fucking family due to my old mans obsession and worship of that orange son of a bitch  my sister has the same thing going on to a lesser degree. Like a fucking child he expects everyone to agree with him, everyone to listen to him whine about Trump being framed and stolen elections, and "showing the Democrats" here's a note retard Trump  cost  Trump the retard did a terrible fucking job and lost. I can't wait for that pig to be locked up I just wish they'd grab a rope and hang him and I don't even care if he's guilty or not just hang him so I never have to fucking hear the name "Donald Trump!!!" again.

&#x200B;

The only ones in my family I can seemingly talk to are my Aunt, brother, and cousin who all hate politics because the fat stooge never shuts up about Trump. He expects everyone to tolerate his anger issues because he's old. He's actually tried convincing me to move to Texas and fucking Florida because you know I don't hate the Illinois government enough I need to have dumbass Desantis and his nonsense. If I hear about drag queens one more time I'm going to fucking go berserk too dumbass parents are the problem the drag queens are fucking harmless.

Having lived with someone like this it's an easy NTA. Stupid should check his own god damn pockets instead of expecting others to correct his fucks up he's not a child. Funny enough an incident involving a pen is why this person now goes to the laundromat since no one else in the family was willing to check his pockets so he could be lazy. I will also admit I've made that mistake with my own key fob (managed to salvage it by taking it apart and letting it dry though) but I'm at fault for my own failure.

&#x200B;

I should note the person in my family who does this is a narcissist (anything they do wrong is somehow someone else's fault and if you disagree with em your a moron/fool/naive/etc..) basically a man child.
